{"id":"57bc181e540acfcec659a119caf83cff55ca0c25","url":"https://www.ithome.com/1/002/618.htm","title":"vivo X500 Pro 系列手机官宣全球首发搭载天玑 9600 Pro 旗舰芯片","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"IT之家 (ITHome)","byline":"作者：汪淼","excerpt":"vivo 高级副总裁、首席技术官施玉坚宣布，vivo X500 Pro 系列手机全球首发搭载天玑 9600 Pro 旗舰芯片，将于 9 月 21 日发布。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"paragraph\">\r\n            <p>感谢IT之家网友 <a href=\"https://m.ithome.com/html/app/open.html?url=ithome%3A%2F%2Fuserpage%3Fid%3D795776\" rel=\"nofollow\">風見暉一</a> 的线索投递！</p>\r\n            <p data-vmark=\"deb2\"><a href=\"https://www.ithome.com/\" target=\"_blank\">IT之家</a> 9 月 15 日消息，在今日的 2026 联发科天玑旗舰新品发布会上，vivo 高级副总裁、首席技术官施玉坚宣布，<strong>vivo X500 Pro 系列手机全球首发搭载天玑 9600 Pro 旗舰芯片</strong>，将于 9 月 21 日发布。</p><p data-vmark=\"440f\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/485fa93b-388d-4a86-b1a7-ca3f51553536.jpg@s_2,w_820,h_615\" w=\"1440\" h=\"1080\" data-mpos=\"0,2\" data-vmark=\"a25e\" title=\"vivo X500 Pro 系列手机官宣全球首发搭载天玑 9600 Pro 旗舰芯片\" srcset=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/485fa93b-388d-4a86-b1a7-ca3f51553536.jpg 2x\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/485fa93b-388d-4a86-b1a7-ca3f51553536.jpg@s_2,w_820,h_615\" width=\"1440\" height=\"615\"></p><p data-vmark=\"24e9\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/3cf5ca83-1b0b-4f64-9f88-bdde5698bccb.jpg@s_2,w_820,h_615\" w=\"1440\" h=\"1080\" data-mpos=\"0,2\" data-vmark=\"7b90\" title=\"vivo X500 Pro 系列手机官宣全球首发搭载天玑 9600 Pro 旗舰芯片\" srcset=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/3cf5ca83-1b0b-4f64-9f88-bdde5698bccb.jpg 2x\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/3cf5ca83-1b0b-4f64-9f88-bdde5698bccb.jpg@s_2,w_820,h_615\" width=\"1440\" height=\"615\"></p><p data-vmark=\"5b1a\">施玉坚介绍，<strong>vivo 率先提出双超大核 CPU 架构设计思路</strong>，与联发科历经三年联合研发，打造了天玑 9600 Pro 旗舰芯片。</p><p data-vmark=\"f50d\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/5f78289c-72d4-45dc-866a-4600fe28d7c7.jpg@s_2,w_820,h_615\" w=\"1440\" h=\"1080\" data-mpos=\"0,2\" data-vmark=\"d590\" title=\"vivo X500 Pro 系列手机官宣全球首发搭载天玑 9600 Pro 旗舰芯片\" srcset=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/5f78289c-72d4-45dc-866a-4600fe28d7c7.jpg 2x\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/5f78289c-72d4-45dc-866a-4600fe28d7c7.jpg@s_2,w_820,h_615\" width=\"1440\" height=\"615\"></p><p data-vmark=\"e442\">IT之家从发布会现场获悉，vivo 还与联发科在影像方面进行深度合作，<strong>共同定义了蓝晶芯片技术栈</strong>，带来五大影像联合技术。</p><p data-vmark=\"0711\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/107fb552-90b3-4e7c-9417-bb2248b639c8.jpg@s_2,w_820,h_615\" w=\"1440\" h=\"1080\" data-mpos=\"0,2\" data-vmark=\"e17b\" title=\"vivo X500 Pro 系列手机官宣全球首发搭载天玑 9600 Pro 旗舰芯片\" srcset=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/107fb552-90b3-4e7c-9417-bb2248b639c8.jpg 2x\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/107fb552-90b3-4e7c-9417-bb2248b639c8.jpg@s_2,w_820,h_615\" width=\"1440\" height=\"615\"></p><p data-vmark=\"a94b\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/ab4f9930-03a5-4eee-afd2-296d49c3b6d5.jpg@s_2,w_820,h_615\" w=\"1440\" h=\"1080\" data-mpos=\"2,2\" data-vmark=\"0bcb\" title=\"vivo X500 Pro 系列手机官宣全球首发搭载天玑 9600 Pro 旗舰芯片\" srcset=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/ab4f9930-03a5-4eee-afd2-296d49c3b6d5.jpg 2x\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/ab4f9930-03a5-4eee-afd2-296d49c3b6d5.jpg@s_2,w_820,h_615\" width=\"1440\" height=\"615\"></p><p data-vmark=\"13c6\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/5e3ef98a-56f7-4e5c-a97d-4b1a7c8fff09.jpg@s_2,w_820,h_617\" w=\"1440\" h=\"1084\" data-mpos=\"2,2\" data-vmark=\"9e19\" title=\"vivo X500 Pro 系列手机官宣全球首发搭载天玑 9600 Pro 旗舰芯片\" srcset=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/5e3ef98a-56f7-4e5c-a97d-4b1a7c8fff09.jpg 2x\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/5e3ef98a-56f7-4e5c-a97d-4b1a7c8fff09.jpg@s_2,w_820,h_6